{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05791","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其七 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵矶盘礴兮溜奔错漱，冷风兮镇冥壑。\n研苔滋兮泉珠洁，一饮一憩兮气想灭。\n磷涟清淬兮涤烦矶，灵仙境兮仁智归。\n中有琴兮徽以玉，峨峨汤汤兮弹此曲，寄声知音兮同所欲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}